        <mxCell id="notes" value="HOW TO READ THIS MAP&#xa;Each row is one request path. Each column is one architecture layer. Arrows show the order of steps, and the diamond shapes are decisions.&#xa;Dashed borders mark optional services. Amber diamonds are decisions.&#xa;&#xa;BOOT SEQUENCE&#xa;env.js → security middleware chain → bootstrapFramework(app) → HTTP or HTTPS server with attachChatbot → listen on PORT (default 4000) → startSchemaCollector(60000)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1134" width="1446" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
